### Cross-type private endpoints (ContentAdminApi)

### Hub summary — KPIs + rail counts
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/summary?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### Redirects written by slug changes of published pages
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/redirects?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}
